{"text":"Hello {first_name},

This note follows an earlier message from {clinic_name}. We would like you to book a follow-up visit. Please do so by {due_by}.

To book, call us at {clinic_phone}. We are happy to help.

If you do not want these reminders, you can stop them here: {opt_out_link}

Thank you,
{clinic_name}"}
